{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55499","headline":"天柱峰（题拟） · 李明","name":"天柱峰（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天柱一峰藏日月，洞门千仞锁云雷。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷四六《安庆府》。\n）（按：《天柱山志》收白居易《题天柱峰》，其三四两句与此同，详本书卷二八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}